# Cloudflare API Token for Akash Provider Optimizations
# ============================================================
# This secret stores the Cloudflare API token used for:
# - SSL/TLS configuration
# - DNS management automation
# - Security settings
# - Analytics and monitoring
#
# Token Permissions Required:
# - Zone - Zone - Read
# - Zone - SSL and Certificates - Edit
# - Zone - DNS - Edit
# - Zone - Settings - Edit
# - Account - Account Settings - Read
#
# GENERATION INSTRUCTIONS:
# 1. Copy your API token (from Cloudflare Dashboard)
# 2. Encrypt with agenix:
#
#    agenix -e secrets/cloudflare-api-token.age
#
# 3. Paste token content (just the token string, no JSON):
#
#    cfut_iotByCUQLpSaYNMwiS1IdIvYtjJTTGexDrPKCLev854ddfb5
#
# 4. Save and exit editor
#
# 5. Add to agenix secrets registry in modules/system/agenix-secrets-registry.nix:
#
#    cloudflare-api-token = {
#      file = "${inputs.self}/secrets/cloudflare-api-token.age";
#      mode = "400";
#      owner = "root";
#      group = "root";
#    };
#
# USAGE:
# After deployment, token will be available at /run/agenix/cloudflare-api-token
#
# Run optimization script:
#   export CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN=$(cat /run/agenix/cloudflare-api-token)
#   /etc/nixos/scripts/cloudflare-optimizations-apply.sh apply
#
# SECURITY NOTES:
# - Token expires: 2027-04-01
# - Token permissions: Read-only + SSL/DNS/Settings Edit
# - Store securely with agenix (never commit plain token to git)
# - Rotate if compromised or annually
#
# CURRENT TOKEN (DO NOT COMMIT TO GIT):
# cfut_iotByCUQLpSaYNMwiS1IdIvYtjJTTGexDrPKCLev854ddfb5
